        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/b07b471317b2fbb369d38897e569d0fe.poster.avif?t=1763739267\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/b07b471317b2fbb369d38897e569d0fe.webm?t=1763739267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide into the world of Squarely, a low stakes puzzle game all about precise positioning and forward thinking that is easy to learn but hard to master. Push, Slide, Teleport, Boost and Bash your Squares to their goals through over 140 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/d95f1e9ce4a6ae07ab23c1e896a40b0c.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=162 /></span>levels at your own pace or challenge yourself and the creators own scores while pursuing each levels perfect solution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/8e4b108fc22897b2431e96fa5b70b218.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no timers or turn limits you never have to worry a move will be your last, once you have finished enough of a chapter you can even move on and come back to challenge the harder puzzles later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/fddd4fa72c908fdbbd6ed194eefb260d.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through each chapter you will unlock new tiles, colours and obstacles that will help and hinder you but don't stress, each new mechanic comes with a tutorial level and some introductory puzzles that will have you mastering the new movement in no time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/d95f1e9ce4a6ae07ab23c1e896a40b0c.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has many solutions, some more efficient than others. Show your skill with the Squares by watching your moves and attaining Silver in a puzzle or display true mastery by matching the creators score to be awarded Gold. Who knows, maybe you can see what even the puzzle's creator could not and find an even better solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/b07b471317b2fbb369d38897e569d0fe.poster.avif?t=1763739267\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/b07b471317b2fbb369d38897e569d0fe.webm?t=1763739267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide into the world of Squarely, a low stakes puzzle game all about precise positioning and forward thinking that is easy to learn but hard to master. Push, Slide, Teleport, Boost and Bash your Squares to their goals through over 140 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/d95f1e9ce4a6ae07ab23c1e896a40b0c.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=162 /></span>levels at your own pace or challenge yourself and the creators own scores while pursuing each levels perfect solution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/8e4b108fc22897b2431e96fa5b70b218.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no timers or turn limits you never have to worry a move will be your last, once you have finished enough of a chapter you can even move on and come back to challenge the harder puzzles later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/fddd4fa72c908fdbbd6ed194eefb260d.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through each chapter you will unlock new tiles, colours and obstacles that will help and hinder you but don't stress, each new mechanic comes with a tutorial level and some introductory puzzles that will have you mastering the new movement in no time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880290/extras/d95f1e9ce4a6ae07ab23c1e896a40b0c.avif?t=1763739267\" width=1200 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has many solutions, some more efficient than others. Show your skill with the Squares by watching your moves and attaining Silver in a puzzle or display true mastery by matching the creators score to be awarded Gold. Who knows, maybe you can see what even the puzzle's creator could not and find an even better solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Squarely is a chilled-out puzzle game of precision and strategy. Push, Slide, Boost and Teleport your way through over 140 handcrafted levels with no time pressure. Learn new mechanics as you advance, unlock colorful tiles, and challenge yourself to master each puzzle.",
